<p>NOTES: Full company name is Martin Industries Inc.</p>
<p>Pro Forma results exclude non-cash employee stock option plan (ESOP) compensation expenses, net of tax, totaling: $321,000 in 1997 Q2 vs $697,000 in 1996; and $738,000 in 1st half 1997 vs $1,343,000 in 1996.</p>
<p>Shares outstanding in first two tables exlude ESOP shares. ESOP shares are included in the pro forma results tables.</p>
<p>Discontinued operation is the company's metal office furniture segment, which was discontinued in February 1997.</p>
